'''Demolition Derby Driver''' is a driving [[Jobs|job]], specializing crashing cars together. A freestyle class job, it has many upgrades and extras.

==Unlocking Demolition Derby Driver==
Demolition Derby Driver can be unlocked by speaking with any of the Derby trainers at the various speedways.

==Trainers==
* Burt 'Wrecking' Crewe in [[Frost Ridge Speedway]]
* Crash Davis in [[Thunder Falls Speedway]]
* Rip Ringa in [[Tangletrack Speedway]]
* Mad Jack in [[Wildwood Speedway]]

==Tracks==
* Frost Ridge Speedway in [[Snowhill]]
* Thunder Falls Speedway in [[Lakeshore]]
* Tangletrack Speedway in [[Briarwood]]
* Wildwood Speedway in [[Sanctuary]]

==Notes==
Wildwood Speedway and Thunder Falls Speedway are both the same demolition area.
